# Baku Weighted Meta-Allocator — testnet deployment record
# Deployed + exercised end-to-end on 2026-06-05 (stellar testnet, source `admin`).
#
# Demo allocation: 30% Blend (lending) / 40% Soroswap (LP swap-and-hold) / 30% native.
# The allocator IS a StrategyInterface; for the demo its `vault` == admin (the
# depositor) and each child's `vault` == the allocator (fresh instances bound to it).
#
# NOTE: both children are registered authoritative=true so Soroswap can carry the
# 40% weight. That is a DEMO-ONLY choice — V0 normally forbids LP children from
# carrying weight (current_value is an estimate). Production needs the deferred
# TWAP/oracle hardening before a Soroswap child holds real weight.
#
# Verified flow (see stellar.expert tx links below):
#   deposit(100 XLM) -> 30 Blend / 40 Soroswap (20 swapped to 2.7347 USDC) / 30 native
#   withdraw(20 XLM) -> pulled strictly pro-rata, swapped USDC back, returned ~20 XLM
NETWORK=testnet

ADMIN_ADDR=GCWHACNPCEV6FPANBP3WMHFSR3LXMZO5CNIZNEKEKV7PAM2TBJ5HEVTV
ALLOCATOR_VAULT=GCWHACNPCEV6FPANBP3WMHFSR3LXMZO5CNIZNEKEKV7PAM2TBJ5HEVTV
ASSET_XLM_SAC=CDLZFC3SYJYDZT7K67VZ75HPJVIEUVNIXF47ZG2FB2RMQQVU2HHGCYSC

