# --- Wired into canonical VAULT_XLM on 2026-06-05 ---
# The demo allocator was drained to empty, rebound to the vault
# (allocator.set_vault -> VAULT_XLM), and registered as an INACTIVE strategy.
# active_strategy stays Blend (CAGIMEB3...); total_assets unaffected (the vault
# only counts the active strategy). Registration is irreversible (the vault has
# no remove_strategy) — same as the existing *_V0_UNFIXED registry entries.
VAULT_XLM=CCY337D4WZ6OECCTQMWIMWT2CHBC73YY5JFRKBJ665O654KMUG3CP7YH
ALLOCATOR_REGISTERED_ON_VAULT_XLM=true
ALLOCATOR_ACTIVE_ON_VAULT_XLM=false
# To ACTIVATE (gated — routes the vault's full ~1033 XLM through 30/40/30,
# incl. a large Soroswap LP swap; only do with the LP-authoritative caveat in mind):
#   stellar contract invoke --id CCY337... --source admin --network testnet -- \
#     rebalance --admin GCWHAC... --to_strategy CDN5KSWY...
# To REVERSE an activation, rebalance back to Blend:
#   ... rebalance --admin GCWHAC... --to_strategy CAGIMEB3...

# --- ACTIVATED on VAULT_XLM 2026-06-05 (vault.rebalance Blend -> allocator) ---
# tx: 4870bc7e192c7fb815f6abcf311b5c1b9ad9e67bce6d9635920c8f0a3b51c11c
# Drained 1036.92 XLM from Blend; allocator now ACTIVE with realized split:
#   native   311.08 XLM (30.04%)
#   blend    311.08 XLM (30.04%)  [child CAASZTCS..., supplied to Blend pool]
#   soroswap 413.53 XLM (39.93%)  [child CAI5MA4F..., 207.38 XLM + 28.36 USDC]
#   vault total_assets = 1035.68 XLM (−1.24 XLM = Soroswap 0.3%/leg swap fee)
# The vault's value now depends on the Soroswap LP estimate (current_value).
# REVERSE (re-consolidate into Blend, costs another ~0.12% swap fee):
#   stellar contract invoke --id CCY337... --source admin --network testnet -- \
#     rebalance --admin GCWHAC... --to_strategy CAGIMEB3MLO6AV5F2WZXGOI6KEQ7MNWA4TKOORP5IGDSTIR7UBRCKBUJ
TX_ACTIVATE_REBALANCE=4870bc7e192c7fb815f6abcf311b5c1b9ad9e67bce6d9635920c8f0a3b51c11c

# --- 2026-06-06: Soroswap V1 real-LP upgrade + LIVE FINDING ---
# New real-LP Soroswap child deployed (vault=allocator):
ALLOC_SOROSWAP_LP_CHILD_XLM=CBOUW5FFO2J47N5FLC7W2LOJKULWO5LTIGI7FD2WHPY6IA2ZVNSSRKQW
# (old swap-and-hold child CAI5MA4FJ5XDIWW7P5X73JH7NDGUF5OKKXXPQESVQPH64ZJ5FXPRNAQE removed from allocator; still deployed, empty)
#
# PROVEN on-chain: LP deposit (add_liquidity, minted 725,719,403 LP tokens) and
# LP withdraw (remove_liquidity, burned all LP + swapped back) both work.
#
# BLOCKER found by live testing: the FULL user redeem path
#   vault.redeem -> allocator.withdraw -> Blend pool.submit(Withdraw)
#                                       + Soroswap remove_liquidity + swap-back
# in ONE tx exceeds Soroban's per-tx memory budget (Error(Budget,ExceededLimit) /
# Memory(OutOfBoundsGrowth)). The old swap-and-hold redeem fit; remove_liquidity
# is the marginal weight that tips the combined Blend+LP tree over the host limit.
#
# REMEDIATION (done): drained the LP child to native (allocator.rebalance, lighter),
# recovered a stuck test-user-1 deposit (redeem verified working once LP empty),
# and reverted the canonical vault to plain Blend (CAGIMEB3...) — safe, redeemable,
# earning. Allocator now inactive/empty. Cost of the live experiment ~2.6 XLM in
# cumulative Soroswap swap fees (testnet).
ALLOCATOR_ACTIVE_NOTE=reverted_to_blend_2026-06-06_redeem_memory_limit

# --- 2026-06-06: Multi-tx buffer-first redemption — LIVE PROOF (fresh demo vault) ---
